.TH PHX 1 "2026-10-18" "Phalanx Duel" "Phalanx Duel Local Tooling"
.SH NAME
phx \- unified Phalanx Duel control plane & multicall CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B phx
.I command
.RI [ subcommand ]
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B phx-ctl
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B phx
is the central control plane for Phalanx Duel, inspired by
.BR zdots-ctl
and
.BR kubectl .
It operates as a multicall binary: invoking it directly or through namespaced symlinks
.RB ( phx-check ,
.BR phx-top ,
.BR phx-services ,
etc.) routes seamlessly to the canonical implementations.
.SH COMMAND CATEGORIES
.SS Platform & Services
.TP
.B up, down, restart
Start, stop, or restart all local services in a detached tmux session.
.TP
.B status, logs
Query service lifecycle state or tail active background service logs.
.TP
.B services [command]
Full service manager for server, client, admin, and background daemons.
.TP
.B setup
Automate the initial environment bootstrap from git clone to ready.
.TP
.B fix
Execute repository workspace fixers and deduplication scripts.
.TP
.B install-localhost
Install and configure the project-owned Nginx vhost for *.localhost.
.SS Diagnostics & Verification
.TP
.B check
Run the unified multi-phase system check (Build, Lint, DB Guards, Types, Tests).
.TP
.B test
Run standardized Vitest, Playwright, or unit test suites.
.TP
.B health
Probe API /health, /ready, and database connectivity.
.TP
.B top
Interactive curses-style game runtime and combat transaction monitor.
.TP
.B doctor
Audit system runtimes, Node, pnpm, Python, DuckDB, Docker, and ports.
.TP
.B o11y
Verify OpenTelemetry Collector, OpenObserve, and Jaeger routes.
.TP
.B dock [command]
Run commands inside an isolated Docker automation container.
.SS Tournament & Network
.TP
.B tournament check
Inspect LAN host IP, firewall rules, listener sockets, and DNS mappings.
.TP
.B tournament top
Real-time Wi-Fi RF quality, packet rate, and player socket monitor.
.TP
.B tournament ports
Audit active tournament listener ports across the local host.
.SS Analytics & Datalake
.TP
.B datalake [build|query|summary|tables|shell]
Operate the multi-repository DuckDB and Apache Parquet engineering datalake.
.TP
.B docs
Build and serve the architecture documentation library SPA on port 3334.
.TP
.B gource
Render multi-repo cinematic 3D git repository visual history.
.SS Agent & Skills
.TP
.B skills [list|show|audit]
Inspect and audit specialized agent skills (.agents/skills/).
.TP
.B agent [audit|guide|capabilities|ctx]
Agent integration audit, capabilities inspection, and context extraction.
.SS Platform Meta
.TP
.B version
Display platform version, build ID, and git commit hash.
.TP
.B man [command]
Render terminal manual page using mandoc or man.
.TP
.B completion [bash|zsh]
Generate shell auto-completion scripts.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR phx-services (1),
.BR phx-demo-ctl (1),
.BR phx-healthcheck (1),
.BR phx-dock (1),
.BR mandoc (1)
